Scoped chromashift integer chroma plane shift

The option table, the yuv_pix_fmts negotiation subset and the luma copy and
smear and wrap chroma index semantics in src/video-ops/chromashift.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_chromashift.c (smear_slice8, wrap_slice8, filter_frame,
config_input, chromashift_options, yuv_pix_fmts).
